      "id": "line_001",
      "speaker_id": "56af5ced-7569-4f37-9c7b-c85730aa0380",
      "text": "Hi Maya! Do you have a healthy routine?",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "Present Simple — question with do"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_002",
      "speaker_id": "98ecd1b5-3807-4dc6-8009-f60d87cb5c48",
      "text": "Yes, I do! I start my day early.",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "Present Simple — statement"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_003",
      "speaker_id": "56af5ced-7569-4f37-9c7b-c85730aa0380",
      "text": "That is great. What do you do first?",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "Present Simple — question word"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_004",
      "speaker_id": "98ecd1b5-3807-4dc6-8009-f60d87cb5c48",
      "text": "I drink water. Then I have breakfast.",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [
          "have breakfast"
        ],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "Present Simple — habit"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_005",
      "speaker_id": "56af5ced-7569-4f37-9c7b-c85730aa0380",
      "text": "Oh really? What do you eat for breakfast?",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "Present Simple — question"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_006",
      "speaker_id": "98ecd1b5-3807-4dc6-8009-f60d87cb5c48",
      "text": "I eat fruit and eggs. It is good.",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "Present Simple — preference"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_007",
      "speaker_id": "56af5ced-7569-4f37-9c7b-c85730aa0380",
      "text": "Nice! Do you do exercise in the morning?",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [
          "do exercise"
        ],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "Present Simple — yes/no question"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_008",
      "speaker_id": "98ecd1b5-3807-4dc6-8009-f60d87cb5c48",
      "text": "Yes, I walk in the park. Do you?",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "Present Simple — short question"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_009",
      "speaker_id": "56af5ced-7569-4f37-9c7b-c85730aa0380",
      "text": "No, I do exercise in the evening.",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [
          "do exercise"
        ],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "Present Simple — routine"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_010",
      "speaker_id": "98ecd1b5-3807-4dc6-8009-f60d87cb5c48",
      "text": "Totally. Do you cook healthy food for dinner?",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "Present Simple — yes/no question"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_011",
      "speaker_id": "56af5ced-7569-4f37-9c7b-c85730aa0380",
      "text": "Yes, I make dinner at home every night.",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [
          "make dinner"
        ],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "Present Simple — routine"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_012",
      "speaker_id": "98ecd1b5-3807-4dc6-8009-f60d87cb5c48",
      "text": "That is very healthy. What time do you sleep?",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "Present Simple — time question"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_013",
      "speaker_id": "56af5ced-7569-4f37-9c7b-c85730aa0380",
      "text": "I go to sleep at ten o'clock.",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [
          "go to sleep"
        ],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "Present Simple — time prepositions"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_014",
      "speaker_id": "98ecd1b5-3807-4dc6-8009-f60d87cb5c48",
      "text": "Good sleep is very important for us.",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "Present Simple — adjective statement"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_015",
      "speaker_id": "56af5ced-7569-4f37-9c7b-c85730aa0380",
      "text": "I know, right? A good routine is easy.",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "Present Simple — simple opinion"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_016",
      "speaker_id": "98ecd1b5-3807-4dc6-8009-f60d87cb5c48",
      "text": "Yes! Eat well, sleep well, and feel good.",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "Imperative — simple advice"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_017",
      "speaker_id": "56af5ced-7569-4f37-9c7b-c85730aa0380",
      "text": "Totally! I feel happy every weekday now.",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "Present Simple — feelings"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_018",
      "speaker_id": "98ecd1b5-3807-4dc6-8009-f60d87cb5c48",
      "text": "Me too! Let us keep this good routine.",
      "language_notes": {
        "collocations": [],
        "idioms": [],
        "grammar_point": "Imperative — suggestion with let us"
      }
    }
  ],
